    {
      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"It's Air Jordan on my flip-flops (Woo)",
          "rhyme":"Op",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"And kill me now if I did it all for hip-hop (K-ch, blaow)",
          "rhyme":"Op",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"I might die before I detox",
          "rhyme":"Oks",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"This ain't high school, no little Asian I can cheat off (Mi-mi-mi-mi-mi-mi-mi-mi)",
          "rhyme":"Of",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"We keep chiefin' while police watch (Woo)",
          "rhyme":"atS",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Loss in vibration, sirens blowin' up the weed spot (Ha, yeah)",
          "rhyme":"Ot",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"The Heisman hopefuls all growin' up to be cops",
          "rhyme":"Op",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Chasin' after gangsters but they never find the G-spot (Oh)",
          "rhyme":"Ot",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"I'm recordin' like I'll die tomorrow (Die)",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"At the rate I'm gettin' high, it'll be hard for me to find tomorrow (Find)",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"But I just pray that I'll survive tomorrow (Oh my God)",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"As she cries in sorrow (Oh my God)",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"She just needs some time to borrow, she'll be smilin' by tomorrow",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Everything will be so fine tomorrow (Yeah)",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"Put the white away, we can do some lines tomorrow",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"Come say \"Hi\" to Morrow (Hello)",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        }
